      "content": "**序数词**表示顺序，如 first (第一)、second (第二)、third (第三)。\n\n**规则**：\n- 一般在基数词后加 -th：four → fourth\n- 特殊变化：one → first, two → second, three → third\n\n**例句**：My classroom is on the third floor. (我的教室在三楼。)"
